src/subclass.rs backports the KVO teardown fix from AccessKit #835
(https://github.com/AccessKit/accesskit/commit/451885c1850ec1800cea1d0660bf8ba62e0f410d).
The platform node declaration and helper methods were split out of src/node.rs
to fit Sheprd's file size limit, without changing their behavior.

Remove this patch when GPUI uses a macOS adapter that includes #835 or no longer
uses the subclassing adapter. See docs/macos-window-close.md.
